  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment Help Guide\n\n### How to Run an MTD IT Report\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 27 Mar, 2025 at  3:37 PM\n\nNavigation: Self Assessment > MTD IT Income Report\n\nOnce in this section, chose the Tax Year in the drop down available and click 'Download Report'.\n\nOnce downloaded, you should be able to find an Excel Workbook in your download folder. It will look similar to the one below:\n\nEvident in the file, you can see which of your clients are applicable for April 2026, and further which clients would be applicable in April 2027.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
